  "details": "If, while VRChat is launching, the SteamVR dashboard is open, the game will skip the login menu (black screen, very quiet music) and will directly try to load the home but it ill get stuck on \"Connecting\" until the game is restarted.\n\nIt has been happening on quite some VRChat and SteamVR builds, but as of writing this, I use VRChat build 1878 and SteamVR 2.17.6 beta.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/t0mSQuQgO4s",
